    {
      "title": "Filtry pro detail projektu (Filters for the project drill-down)",
      "text": "%md\nVyberte projekt, kategorii a dodavatele (IČO z tabulky V3) a spusťte odstavce níže.\n(Choose a project, a category and a supplier ID from table V3, then run the paragraphs below.)\n\nProjekt (project): $${project\u003dFVE-2026-02}\n\nKategorie (category): $${category\u003dPANELS,PANELS|INVERTERS|BATTERIES|STRUCTURES|CABLES|EARTHWORKS|GRID|DESIGN|SURVEY|OTHER}\n\nDodavatel, IČO (supplier ID): $${supplier\u003d}",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-11-18 14:14:10.198",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true
        },
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
